# Raw vocabulary dumps are NOT committed.
#
# ulan_rel_0126.zip is 190 MB compressed and expands to multiples of that.
# Git stores every version of a binary forever, so committing one is easy and
# unpleasant to undo -- every clone from then on pays for it.
#
# What IS committed is the DERIVED SUBSET in the parent directory: the artists
# actually in our catalogue, extracted from this dump. That is small, diffable,
# and the only part we use.
#
# Re-downloadable from http://ulandownloads.getty.edu/ -- the snapshot date is
# recorded in ../README.md so a rebuild uses the same input.
*
!.gitignore
